  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat: add workflow_dispatch trigger to mkdocs workflow template 2026-03-19\n- feat: Fixed duplicated Tags issue #155 2026-03-13\n- fix: recognize net10+ target frameworks for modern C# feature emission 2026-03-11\n- feat: add --base-url CLI option with validation, tests, and docs 2026-03-11\n- feat: add --security-scheme CLI option for specs missing auth (#140) 2026-03-10\n- feat: add Claude Code skill for AI-assisted SDK generation 2026-03-10\n- feat: migrate initialize command from .sln to .slnx format 2026-03-09\n- feat: use default/const values from OpenAPI parameters as C# default parameter values 2026-03-05\n- feat: improve oneOf/anyOf ergonomics with semantic variant naming (#133) 2026-03-05\n- feat: More broad support for .http files 2026-03-04\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix: Handle empty API key env vars in integration tests 2026-03-19\n- fix: Resolve remaining CA1031 warnings and make I/O fully async 2026-03-19\n- fix: Resolve CA1849 and null dereference warnings 2026-03-19\n- fix: Improve AnyOf JSON converter discrimination for schemas without discriminator 2026-03-19\n- fix: skip test files with multiple [TestMethod] in Legacy docs mode 2026-03-19\n- fix: Remove redundant pull_request trigger from dotnet.yml template 2026-03-19\n- fix: Use squash merge in auto-merge workflow template 2026-03-19\n- fix: Don't send empty query values for optional AnyOf parameters 2026-03-19\n- Add explicit [JsonSerializable] attributes per type for AOT compatibility (#173) 2026-03-19\n- fix: Fixed Vectara spec issues. 2026-03-15",
